			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"菲尔戈黛特"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 413110101,
					"content": "海灯节又快到了啊，今年要不要把客栈打扮一下呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110102,
					"content": "海灯节？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413110103,
					"content": "你不知道吗？ 每年的第一个月圆之夜，就是璃月的「海灯节」哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110104,
					"content": "这是一个纪念英雄的节日，在夜里，人们会放出「霄灯」和「明霄灯」，升上夜空。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110105,
					"content": "那些灯的寓意，是「愿薪火相传，美德不灭」。我们相信夜海的明灯会引导过往的英魂归乡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110106,
					"content": "哇…听起来像是个很盛大的节日呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110107,
					"content": "说不定…还会有很多好吃的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110108,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，你能听懂我的意思吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110109,
					"content": "你们是想要去参加海灯节吗？那正好。「海灯节」当夜之前的一段时间，都可以算是节日。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110110,
					"content": "在这段时间里，可以祈祷平安、祛除厄运。用璃月人的话说就是「辞旧迎新」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110111,
					"content": "如果你们想要参加的话，现在去也不迟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110112,
					"content": "还有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110113,
					"content": "还有？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413110114,
					"content": "如果可以的话…嗯…你们要试试邀请魈一起去吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110115,
					"content": "他和我们的关系不近，我也不太好去问他。但我看你们好像已经有点混熟了，不如…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110116,
					"content": "可是，考虑到魈现在的心情…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413110117,
					"content": "嗯，这几天里去打扰他，确实有点不太好呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110118,
					"content": "是吗…没关系！这也只是我随口一说而已。你们还是快点去<color=#00E1FFFF>璃月港</color>吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110119,
					"content": "要是去太晚，城里就全都是人了，想要逛逛玩玩也就很费劲了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413110120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 413110120,
					"content": "快去吧，祝你们海灯节玩得开心！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4131103,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4131103
